{"id":"mahabharata-13-081","work":"mahabharata","part":13,"partName":"अनुशासनपर्व","partNameEn":"Anushasana Parva","unit":81,"title":"एकाशीतितमोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 81 · Shri and the dung of the cows","summary":{"en":"Yudhishthira has heard that Shri dwells in cow dung and asks how this came about. Bhishma tells how Shri came to the cows, who at first refused her, and how they agreed in the end that she should live in their dung and urine, the purest of things.","kn":"ಶ್ರೀ ಗೋಮಯದಲ್ಲಿ ವಾಸಿಸುತ್ತಾಳೆಂದು ಕೇಳಿ ಇದು ಹೇಗೆಂದು ಯುಧಿಷ್ಠಿರ ಕೇಳುತ್ತಾನೆ. ಗೋವುಗಳು ಮೊದಲು ತಿರಸ್ಕರಿಸಿದ ಶ್ರೀ ಕೊನೆಗೆ ಅವುಗಳ ಸಗಣಿ-ಗೋಮೂತ್ರದಲ್ಲಿ ವಾಸಿಸಲು ಒಪ್ಪಿಗೆ ಪಡೆದ ಕಥೆಯನ್ನು ಭೀಷ್ಮ ಹೇಳುತ್ತಾನೆ.","hi":"युधिष्ठिर सुनकर पूछते हैं कि श्री गोबर में कैसे रहने लगीं। भीष्म बताते हैं कि गौओं ने पहले श्री को अस्वीकार किया और अन्त में सहमत हुईं कि वह उनके गोबर और मूत्र में रहे, जो सबसे पवित्र हैं।","te":"శ్రీ ఆవు పేడలో నివసిస్తుందని విని అది ఎలా జరిగిందని యుధిష్ఠిరుడు అడుగుతాడు. ఆవులు మొదట శ్రీని నిరాకరించి చివరకు ఆమె తమ పేడ, మూత్రంలో నివసించడానికి అంగీకరించిన కథను భీష్ముడు చెబుతాడు.","ta":"ஸ்ரீ பசுஞ்சாணத்தில் வாழ்கிறாள் என்று கேட்ட யுதிஷ்டிரர் அது எவ்வாறு நேர்ந்தது என்று கேட்க, பசுக்கள் முதலில் மறுத்து இறுதியில் ஸ்ரீ தம் சாணத்திலும் கோமூத்திரத்திலும் வசிக்க ஒப்பிய கதையைப் பீஷ்மர் கூறுகிறார்.","ml":"ശ്രീ ചാണകത്തിൽ വസിക്കുന്നുവെന്ന് കേട്ടിട്ടുള്ള യുധിഷ്ഠിരൻ അത് എങ്ങനെയുണ്ടായെന്ന് ചോദിക്കുന്നു. ശ്രീ പശുക്കളുടെ അടുത്തെത്തിയതും, ആദ്യം അവ അവളെ നിരസിച്ചതും, ഒടുവിൽ ഏറ്റവും ശുദ്ധമായ വസ്തുക്കളായ ചാണകത്തിലും മൂത്രത്തിലും അവൾ വസിക്കാൻ അവ സമ്മതിച്ചതും ഭീഷ്മർ വിവരിക്കുന്നു."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 13.81; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Tue Nov 03 2026","sections":[{"title":"आनुशासनिकपर्व","titleEn":"Anushasanika Parva (The instructions)","verses":[{"text":"युधिष्ठिर उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Yudhishthira said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"मया गवां पुरीषं वै श्रिया जुष्टमिति श्रुतम् ।\nएतदिच्छाम्यहं श्रोतुं संशयोऽत्र हि मे महान् ॥","meaning":{"en":"I have heard that the dung of cows is favoured by Shri. I wish to hear about this, for I have a great doubt here."}},{"text":"भीष्म उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Bhishma said:"}},{"n":2,"text":"अत्राप्युदाहरन्तीममितिहासं पुरातनम् ।\nगोभिर्नृपेह संवादं श्रिया भरतसत्तम ॥","meaning":{"en":"On this too they tell an old account, O best of the Bharatas, a conversation between the cows and Shri, O king."}},{"n":3,"text":"श्रीः कृत्वेह वपुः कान्तं गोमध्यं प्रविवेश ह ।\nगावोऽथ विस्मितास्तस्या दृष्ट्वा रूपस्य संपदम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Shri, taking a lovely form here, once entered the midst of the cows. The cows, seeing the richness of her beauty, were amazed."}},{"text":"गाव ऊचुः","meaning":{"en":"The cows said:"}},{"n":4,"text":"कासि देवि कुतो वा त्वं रूपेणाप्रतिमा भुवि ।\nविस्मिताः स्म महाभागे तव रूपस्य संपदा ॥","meaning":{"en":"Goddess, who are you, and where do you come from, you of unmatched beauty on earth? Greatly blessed one, we are amazed at the richness of your form."}},{"n":5,"text":"इच्छामस्त्वां वयं ज्ञातुं का त्वं क्व च गमिष्यसि ।\nतत्त्वेन च सुवर्णाभे सर्वमेतद्ब्रवीहि नः ॥","meaning":{"en":"We wish to know who you are and where you will go. Golden-hued one, tell us all this truly."}},{"text":"श्रीरुवाच","meaning":{"en":"Shri said:"}},{"n":6,"text":"लोककान्तास्मि भद्रं वः श्रीर्नाम्नेह परिश्रुता ।\nमया दैत्याः परित्यक्ता विनष्टाः शाश्वतीः समाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"I am the beloved of the world, and am renowned here by the name of Shri. By me the Daityas were abandoned and perished for endless years."}},{"n":7,"text":"इन्द्रो विवस्वान्सोमश्च विष्णुरापोऽग्निरेव च ।\nमयाभिपन्ना ऋध्यन्ते ऋषयो देवतास्तथा ॥","meaning":{"en":"Indra, Vivasvan, Soma, Vishnu, the waters, Agni, the sages and the gods all prosper when I come to them."}},{"n":8,"text":"यांश्च द्विषाम्यहं गावस्ते विनश्यन्ति सर्वशः ।\nधर्मार्थकामहीनाश्च ते भवन्त्यसुखान्विताः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Those whom I hate, cows, are destroyed in every way; lacking dharma, wealth and pleasure, they are unhappy."}},{"n":9,"text":"एवंप्रभावां मां गावो विजानीत सुखप्रदाम् ।\nइच्छामि चापि युष्मासु वस्तुं सर्वासु नित्यदा ।\nआगता प्रार्थयानाहं श्रीजुष्टा भवतानघाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Know me, cows, as one of such power, a giver of happiness. I wish to dwell always in all of you. I have come asking; be favoured by Shri, sinless ones."}},{"text":"गाव ऊचुः","meaning":{"en":"The cows said:"}},{"n":10,"text":"अध्रुवां चञ्चलां च त्वां सामान्यां बहुभिः सह ।\nन त्वामिच्छामि भद्रं ते गम्यतां यत्र रोचते ॥","meaning":{"en":"You are unsteady and fickle, shared with many others. We do not want you; good luck to you, go where you like."}},{"n":11,"text":"वपुष्मन्त्यो वयं सर्वाः किमस्माकं त्वयाद्य वै ।\nयत्रेष्टं गम्यतां तत्र कृतकार्या वयं त्वया ॥","meaning":{"en":"We are all beautiful already. What need have we of you? Go where you wish; our purpose is done without you."}},{"text":"श्रीरुवाच","meaning":{"en":"Shri said:"}},{"n":12,"text":"किमेतद्वः क्षमं गावो यन्मां नेहाभ्यनन्दथ ।\nन मां संप्रति गृह्णीथ कस्माद्वै दुर्लभां सतीम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Cows, is this proper of you, that you do not welcome me here? Why do you not accept me now, when I am good and hard to get?"}},{"n":13,"text":"सत्यश्च लोकवादोऽयं लोके चरति सुव्रताः ।\nस्वयं प्राप्ते परिभवो भवतीति विनिश्चयः ॥","meaning":{"en":"This saying is true and goes about the world, O you of good vows: when something comes of itself, it is despised. That is certain."}},{"n":14,"text":"महदुग्रं तपः कृत्वा मां निषेवन्ति मानवाः ।\nदेवदानवगन्धर्वाः पिशाचोरगराक्षसाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"People seek me after doing great and fierce austerity, and so do gods, Danavas, Gandharvas, Pishachas, serpents and Rakshasas."}},{"n":15,"text":"क्षममेतद्धि वो गावः प्रतिगृह्णीत मामिह ।\nनावमन्या ह्यहं सौम्यास्त्रैलोक्ये सचराचरे ॥","meaning":{"en":"It is proper for you, cows, to accept me here. In the three worlds with all moving and unmoving things, I am not to be scorned, gentle ones."}},{"text":"गाव ऊचुः","meaning":{"en":"The cows said:"}},{"n":16,"text":"नावमन्यामहे देवि न त्वां परिभवामहे ।\nअध्रुवा चलचित्तासि ततस्त्वां वर्जयामहे ॥","meaning":{"en":"Goddess, we do not scorn you, nor do we insult you. But you are unsteady and fickle-minded, therefore we shun you."}},{"n":17,"text":"बहुनात्र किमुक्तेन गम्यतां यत्र वाञ्छसि ।\nवपुष्मत्यो वयं सर्वाः किमस्माकं त्वयानघे ॥","meaning":{"en":"What more is there to say? Go where you wish. We are all beautiful; what need have we of you, sinless one?"}},{"text":"श्रीरुवाच","meaning":{"en":"Shri said:"}},{"n":18,"text":"अवज्ञाता भविष्यामि सर्वलोकेषु मानदाः ।\nप्रत्याख्यानेन युष्माभिः प्रसादः क्रियतामिति ॥","meaning":{"en":"I shall be despised in all the worlds, O givers of honour, if you refuse me. Grant me your favour."}},{"n":19,"text":"महाभागा भवत्यो वै शरण्याः शरणागताम् ।\nपरित्रायन्तु मां नित्यं भजमानामनिन्दिताम् ।\nमाननां त्वहमिच्छामि भवत्यः सततं शुभाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Greatly blessed ones, you are a refuge, and I have come to you for refuge. Protect me always, a blameless one who serves you. Auspicious ones, I ask to be honoured by you constantly."}},{"n":20,"text":"अप्येकाङ्गे तु वो वस्तुमिच्छामि च सुकुत्सिते ।\nन वोऽस्ति कुत्सितं किंचिदङ्गेष्वालक्ष्यतेऽनघाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"I would dwell even in one part of you, even a most despised one; yet no part of yours, sinless ones, looks despicable."}},{"n":21,"text":"पुण्याः पवित्राः सुभगा ममादेशं प्रयच्छत ।\nवसेयं यत्र चाङ्गेऽहं तन्मे व्याख्यातुमर्हथ ॥","meaning":{"en":"Holy, pure and fortunate ones, give me your command. You should tell me in which part of your body I should live."}},{"text":"भीष्म उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Bhishma said:"}},{"n":22,"text":"एवमुक्तास्तु ता गावः शुभाः करुणवत्सलाः ।\nसंमन्त्र्य सहिताः सर्वाः श्रियमूचुर्नराधिप ॥","meaning":{"en":"Thus addressed, those auspicious cows, kind and affectionate, all consulted together, O king, and said to Shri:"}},{"n":23,"text":"अवश्यं मानना कार्या तवास्माभिर्यशस्विनि ।\nशकृन्मूत्रे निवस नः पुण्यमेतद्धि नः शुभे ॥","meaning":{"en":"'Glorious one, we must certainly honour you. Dwell in our dung and urine, for this is holy for us, auspicious one.'"}},{"text":"श्रीरुवाच","meaning":{"en":"Shri said:"}},{"n":24,"text":"दिष्ट्या प्रसादो युष्माभिः कृतो मेऽनुग्रहात्मकः ।\nएवं भवतु भद्रं वः पूजितास्मि सुखप्रदाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"'By good fortune you have shown me favour and kindness. So be it; good luck to you. I am honoured, givers of happiness.'"}},{"text":"भीष्म उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Bhishma said:"}},{"n":25,"text":"एवं कृत्वा तु समयं श्रीर्गोभिः सह भारत ।\nपश्यन्तीनां ततस्तासां तत्रैवान्तरधीयत ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having made this agreement with the cows, O Bharata, Shri vanished from there while they watched."}},{"n":26,"text":"एतद्गोशकृतः पुत्र माहात्म्यं तेऽनुवर्णितम् ।\nमाहात्म्यं च गवां भूयः श्रूयतां गदतो मम ॥","meaning":{"en":"Son, I have described to you this greatness of cow dung. Hear again from me, as I speak, the greatness of the cows."}}]}]}